  "summary": "The experiment tested using scgpt as the RNA encoder in a multimodal, multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion, comparing it to the previous best configuration using scvi_n200. The validation accuracy of 0.542 is lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.7062), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may impact performance, but the exact contribution of other components remains uncertain."
